  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1082da33e546bda4997571ad75b67f86, type: 2}
    text: Morning, Pip! Big smile for the mirror...
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: (Something is running down Pip's cheek.)
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1082da33e546bda4997571ad75b67f86, type: 2}
    text: Is that... a tear? Clowns in Tumbleton don't cry. Do they?
